Subject: [EXPERIMENT] ASoC: q6apm: validate FullIO SP and SPVI readback replies

Accept only the pinned SP/SPVI queries with matched tokens, envelope status,
module ID, parameter ID and lengths. BASIC success is not readback. No call
sites yet: configuration readback is not feedback liveness or authorization.

diff --git a/sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/q6apm.c b/sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/q6apm.c
